lacée&nbsp;pour&nbsp;séparer&nbsp;les&nbsp;trichomes&nbsp;de&nbsp;la&nbsp;matière&nbsp;végétale.</span></p><p><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Rosin</strong></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Concentré&nbsp;obtenu&nbsp;sans&nbsp;solvant&nbsp;grâce&nbsp;à&nbsp;la&nbsp;pression&nbsp;et&nbsp;à&nbsp;la&nbsp;chaleur.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: rgb(227, 255, 248);">d</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Kief</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;Poudre&nbsp;constituée&nbsp;principalement&nbsp;de&nbsp;trichomes&nbsp;séparés&nbsp;de&nbsp;la&nbsp;matière&nbsp;végétale.</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Extraction&nbsp;CO₂</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;Méthode&nbsp;d&#39;extraction&nbsp;utilisant&nbsp;du&nbsp;dioxyde&nbsp;de&nbsp;carbone&nbsp;pour&nbsp;récupérer&nbsp;certains&nbsp;composés&nbsp;du&nbsp;chanvre.</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Décarboxylation</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px;">Transformation&nbsp;de&nbsp;certains&nbsp;cannabinoïdes&nbsp;sous&nbsp;l&#39;effet&nbsp;de&nbsp;la&nbsp;chaleur,&nbsp;notamment&nbsp;du&nbsp;CBDa&nbsp;en&nbsp;CBD&nbsp;et&nbsp;du&nbsp;THCa&nbsp;en&nbsp;THC.</span></p>","textAlign":"left","maxWidth":"1200","sectionId":"6","columnCount":3,"marginTop":"negative-medium"}},{"id":"codeembed-1790932611699","type":"CodeEmbed","props":{"code":"<div class="adc-titre-analyses-wrap">
